cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this verification artifact, please cite it as below, and cite the
  paper whose theorems you rely on.
title: >-
  pluf-lean: a Lean 4 verification of maximal filters in the projection lattice
  of a Hilbert space
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 / Mathlib development machine-checking the theorems of a four-paper
  series on maximal filters in the projection lattice of a Hilbert space
  (plufs). The artifact covers 243 audited theorems with an axiom footprint of
  propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound. Four classical inputs (Mathias,
  Marcus-Spielman-Srivastava, Blecher-Weaver, Rowbottom) are quarantined as
  named hypotheses and never discharged, so every mechanized statement is a
  theorem of ZFC.
